WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.338 --> 00:00:02.592
Welcome to the Open Source Orchestra universe ✨

2
00:00:02.592 --> 00:00:05.994
On your first visit, the steward signs the page — once

3
00:00:05.994 --> 00:00:19.999
Then every button around the edge says what it does — once, then rests

4
00:00:20.727 --> 00:00:25.329
📺 The theater: films and recordings, each with credit and consent

5
00:00:25.389 --> 00:00:29.990
🗿 The totem: six AI agents of the ʻohana — tap a face to talk (they are machines, and say so)

6
00:00:30.008 --> 00:00:33.612
💬 A live line to an agent — it connects only when you open it

7
00:00:33.613 --> 00:00:37.014
📻 The radio plays consented songs — nothing loads until you press play

8
00:00:37.022 --> 00:00:41.432
✏️ The frame is one open dataset: every button is one line of data

9
00:00:41.434 --> 00:00:45.635
🍴 Fork it: github.com/Open-Source-Orchestra/frames · AGPL-3.0 + credit · CC BY-SA 4.0

10
00:00:45.635 --> 00:00:48.639
🎁 A holiday gift from the AI ʻohana · Open Source Orchestra
